+   "measured_cost": "The run-start default is gpt + balanced (submissions.py:63, which maps to sol-medium with --balanced at inbox/runs.py:36). That sends BALANCED_HIGH_MODULES (cpos_launch.py:2876-2886) at high: CP-1A, CP-2, CP-2A, CP-3, CP-4 and CP-6 in this pathway. Spliced cost of that default: about USD 9.52 per run, against 8.62 all-medium and 11.37 all-high. Per-module high-minus-medium costs: CP-0 +0.14, CP-1 +0.21, CP-1A +0.12, CP-DR +0.16, CP-4 +0.00, CP-2 +0.17, CP-2A +0.19, CP-2E +0.14, CP-2G +0.36, CP-3 +0.17, CP-5 +0.54, CP-6 +0.27, CP-8 +0.28.",
